      "created_at": "2020-12-31T19:35:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey folks,</p>\n<p>I just got the handbook, and I am so happy with my purchase! Been making pdf versions of heroes and villains to keep a database of sort and having a blast! I ran into a problem though, as the Form Fillable pdf for the villains is a bit incomplete. All but one of the abilitie spaces are missing text boxes for both name and description. Is there a way to get an updated version? Once again, been having alot of fun, can't wait to play with friends!</p>",
